<title>PHILIPPINES: Megaworld up 12.73 pct on buy-in talk.</title>
<headline>Megaworld up 12.73 pct on buy-in talk.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Megaworld Properties and Holdings Inc jumped by 35 centavos, or 12.73 percent, to 3.10 pesos in late Manila trade on talk of a possible buy-in, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Two traders said rumours that a group planned to buy into the company sparked interest in the issue.</p>
<p>Megaworld officials were not immediately available for comment.  </p>
<p>Some 16.79 million shares of Megaworld changed hands as of 11:08 a.m. (0308 GMT).</p>
<p>Megaworld was the second most heavily traded issue at the Philippine stock exchange on Tuesday.</p>
